        [INSERT SCREENSHOT: Database schema from MySQL Workbench showing tables and relationships]
    </div>

    <div class="page-break"></div>

    <!-- Part 2: REST APIs -->
    <h2>Part 2: RESTful API Design &amp; Business Rules</h2>

    <h3>2.1 Student API Endpoints</h3>
    <table>
        <tbody><tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
            <th>Status Code</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/students</td>
            <td>Retrieve all students</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/students/{id}</td>
            <td>Get single student by ID</td>
            <td>200 OK / 404 Not Found</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>POST</td>
            <td>/api/students</td>
            <td>Create new student</td>
            <td>201 Created</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>PUT</td>
            <td>/api/students/{id}</td>
            <td>Update existing student</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>DELETE</td>
            <td>/api/students/{id}</td>
            <td>Delete student</td>
            <td>204 No Content</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/students/{id}/registrations</td>
            <td>Get student's registrations</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody></table>

    <h3>2.2 Course API Endpoints</h3>
    <table>
        <tbody><tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
            <th>Status Code</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/courses</td>
            <td>Retrieve all courses</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/courses/{id}</td>
            <td>Get single course by ID</td>
            <td>200 OK / 404 Not Found</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>POST</td>
            <td>/api/courses</td>
            <td>Create new course</td>
            <td>201 Created</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>PUT</td>
            <td>/api/courses/{id}</td>
            <td>Update existing course</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>DELETE</td>
            <td>/api/courses/{id}</td>
            <td>Delete course</td>
            <td>204 No Content</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/courses/{id}/registrations</td>
            <td>Get course registrations</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody></table>

    <h3>2.3 Registration API Endpoints</h3>
    <table>
        <tbody><tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
            <th>Status Code</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>POST</td>
            <td>/api/registrations</td>
            <td>Register student for course</td>
            <td>201 Created / 400 Bad Request</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/registrations</td>
            <td>Get all registrations</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>GET</td>
            <td>/api/registrations/{id}</td>
            <td>Get registration by ID</td>
            <td>200 OK / 404 Not Found</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>PATCH</td>
            <td>/api/registrations/{id}</td>
            <td>Update registration status/grade</td>
            <td>200 OK</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>DELETE</td>
            <td>/api/registrations/{id}</td>
            <td>Delete registration</td>
            <td>204 No Content</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody></table>

    <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
        [INSERT SCREENSHOT: Postman showing successful GET /api/students request]
    </div>

    <h3>2.4 Business Rules Implementation</h3>
    <p>
        The system enforces three critical business rules in the <strong>RegistrationService</strong> layer:
    </p>

    <div class="warning-box">
        <h4>Rule 1: Maximum Course Limit</h4>
        <p>
            A student cannot register for more than 5 active courses (status = REGISTERED) in the same semester.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Implementation:</strong> Query count of active registrations before allowing new registration.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
if (activeRegistrations &gt;= 5) {
    throw new BusinessRuleViolationException(
        "Student cannot register for more than 5 courses in the same semester"
    );
}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="warning-box">
        <h4>Rule 2: Maximum Seat Capacity</h4>
        <p>
            A course cannot exceed its maximum seat capacity for a given semester.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Implementation:</strong> Count current registrations and compare with maxSeats.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
if (currentEnrollment &gt;= course.getMaxSeats()) {
    throw new BusinessRuleViolationException(
        "Course has reached maximum capacity"
    );
}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="warning-box">
        <h4>Rule 3: Prerequisite Validation</h4>
        <p>
            If a course has a prerequisite, the student must have completed it (status = COMPLETED) before registering.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Implementation:</strong> Check for completed prerequisite registration.</p>
        <div class="code-block">
if (course.getPrerequisite() != null) {
    boolean hasCompleted = registrationRepository
        .existsByStudentAndCourseAndStatus(
            student, 
            course.getPrerequisite(), 
            RegistrationStatus.COMPLETED
        );
    
    if (!hasCompleted) {
        throw new BusinessRuleViolationException(
            "Student must complete prerequisite: " + 
            course.getPrerequisite().getCode()
        );
    }
}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
        [INSERT SCREENSHOT: Postman showing 400 Bad Request error when violating prerequisite rule]
    </div>

    <h3>2.5 Exception Handling Architecture</h3>
    <p>Custom exceptions with @RestControllerAdvice for centralized error handling:</p>
    
    <ul class="feature-list">
        <li><strong>StudentNotFoundException</strong> - Returns 404 with error message</li>
        <li><strong>CourseNotFoundException</strong> - Returns 404 with error message</li>
        <li><strong>RegistrationNotFoundException</strong> - Returns 404 with error message</li>
        <li><strong>BusinessRuleViolationException</strong> - Returns 400 with violation details</li>
    </ul>

    <p>All exceptions return consistent JSON format:</p>
    <div class="code-block">
{
    "timestamp": "2025-11-11T10:30:00",
    "status": 400,
    "error": "Bad Request",
    "message": "Student cannot register for more than 5 courses",
    "path": "/api/registrations"
}
    </div>

    <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
        [INSERT SCREENSHOT: Postman showing formatted error response]
    </div>

