        <li><strong>File Upload</strong> - Support document uploads for student transcripts</li>
        <li><strong>Advanced Search</strong> - Full-text search using Elasticsearch</li>
        <li><strong>Reporting APIs</strong> - Generate enrollment reports, analytics</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Frontend Enhancements:</h4>
    <ul class="feature-list">
        <li><strong>State Management</strong> - Implement Redux or Context API for global state</li>
